{"id":"vod_sn_38755","vodId":"38755","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"洁癖男子青山君","name_cn":"洁癖男子青山君","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4771b4da53be8629020c1efcfe0e4b46.jpg"},"summary":"青山君（置鲇龙太郎 配音）是富士美高中足球部的种子选手。身为前锋的他，拥有着极强的体力和爆发力，传说中，只要有他加入的球队，总会在比赛中得到最后的胜利。可是，虽然青山君十分擅长足球这项崇尚身体碰撞，尽情挥洒汗水的运动，但他本身却是一个有着极度洁癖，异常厌恶身体接触的人，甚至在竞争激烈的赛场上，青山君也要带上橡胶手套。　　和青山君一起拼搏的，有身材壮硕个性傲娇外冷内热的财前勋（关智一 配音）、头脑冷静擅长理性分析，仿佛军师一般存在的坂井一马（保志总一朗 配音）、拥有着使用屁股顶球的特技的冢本仁（阪口大助 配音）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:21","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3efMP3D1ZR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CVff2dD1B41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bjCFaT3Rq61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JVUvphbEUa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nx4qKsR3U91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/reBae6e4VE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RZANgYQARy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ziPdw1Eph71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vCT0RANJvW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fj18HXceHG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fg6GmBycUx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3hXNXYNDDE1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:54.876Z"}